> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Design Decision**: The Financial Year is an **Accounting Module concept only**. It filters `acc_vouchers` and related accounting reports. It does NOT touch `student_fees_deposite`, `expenses`, `income`, `staff_payslip`, or any native LMS fee/finance table. The integration library (`Accounts_integration.php`) syncs native transactions INTO `acc_vouchers` — and that's where the FY stamp gets applied. This means the accounting module shows data by FY, while the native LMS continues to work exactly as before.

