### [MODIFY] [Accvoucher_model.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/lms/application/models/Accvoucher_model.php)

#### `addVoucher()` — Auto-stamp FY on insert (around line 144-150)

Inside the `else` block (new voucher insert), before `$this->db->insert('acc_vouchers', $data)`:

```php
// Auto-derive financial_year_id from voucher_date
if (!isset($data['financial_year_id'])) {
    $voucher_date = $data['voucher_date'] ?? date('Y-m-d');
    $fy_row = $this->db->where('start_date <=', $voucher_date)
                        ->where('end_date >=', $voucher_date)
                        ->get('financial_years')->row();
    if ($fy_row) {
        $data['financial_year_id'] = $fy_row->id;
    }
}
```

**Impact**: Only fires on NEW voucher inserts. Does not touch existing vouchers. Does not change the edit path. If no matching FY found, column remains `NULL` — safe fallback.

#### `getDatatableVouchers()` — Add optional FY filter (line 377-391)

After the existing `->where('acc_vouchers.session_id', $this->current_session)` line, add:

```php
// Optional: filter by financial year if set
if (isset($this->current_financial_year_id) && $this->current_financial_year_id) {
    $this->datatables->where('acc_vouchers.financial_year_id', $this->current_financial_year_id);
}
```

**Impact**: Additive `WHERE` clause. If `current_financial_year_id` is NULL (i.e., admin hasn't selected an FY yet), this clause is skipped entirely — **zero change to existing behavior**.

