### [MODIFY] [Accreport_model.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/lms/application/models/Accreport_model.php)

Add an optional `$financial_year_id = null` parameter to each report method. If provided, use `financial_year_id`; if `null`, fall back to `session_id` (current behavior).

Example for `getDaybookData()`:

```php
// Before: public function getDaybookData($from_date, $to_date)
// After:
public function getDaybookData($from_date, $to_date, $financial_year_id = null)
{
    // ... existing code ...
    if ($financial_year_id) {
        $this->db->where('v.financial_year_id', $financial_year_id);
    } else {
        $this->db->where('v.session_id', $this->current_session);
    }
    // ... rest unchanged ...
}
```

Apply the same pattern to: `getCashbookData`, `getBankbookData`, `getLedgerStatement`, `getExpIncomeTypeReport`, `getTrialBalance`, `getProfitLoss`, `getBalanceSheet`.

**Impact**: The default value is `null`, so every existing caller (without passing FY) gets the exact same query as before. Only callers that explicitly pass an FY ID get filtered data. **Zero regression risk.**

