## Phase 5: Data Backfill Utility (Day 12-13)

### [NEW] Method in Settings Controller: `backfill_financial_years()`

```php
public function backfill_financial_years()
{
    $fys = $this->db->get('financial_years')->result();
    $updated = 0;

    foreach ($fys as $fy) {
        $this->db->where('voucher_date >=', $fy->start_date);
        $this->db->where('voucher_date <=', $fy->end_date);
        $this->db->where('financial_year_id IS NULL', null, false);
        $this->db->update('acc_vouchers', ['financial_year_id' => $fy->id]);
        $updated += $this->db->affected_rows();
    }

    $this->session->set_flashdata('msg', '<div class="alert alert-success">Backfill complete. ' . $updated . ' vouchers updated.</div>');
    redirect('accounts/settings/financial_years');
}
```

**Impact**: Only updates `financial_year_id` column (which we added). Does NOT touch `voucher_date`, `narration`, `amount`, or any other column. Amounts are never recalculated.

